    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c95517c989a5ef4db542288d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使败给了玉藻十字，\n超级溪流仍带给她极大的压迫感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a5702970c5a2ca6210e71ac58c14410b1c19144e07cf3810a7dca68805608af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:751346831f08a09d6d7eab48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "玉藻十字在见识到超级溪流\n与过去截然不同的认真跑法后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb6de98b1f93796eb6dc58874f880376bc7e525c283ab510027e35d1d7b0dc1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c1d4d64b4f2c9691fd4b3d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "发现她确实有了“奔跑的理由”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25cbebab10095958b7603173be7957636dc01579036a728a53e9b1349a3314de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:897329234abcc42bc44486d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在下场比赛“天皇赏（秋）”中，\n小栗帽正等着要与这样的超级溪流一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d17a05e47c3172ad8bb21b4c8894f8cca124ca5e6e5a1f7e0c396a9e7b8c86ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3893786368a42c8183bbf626",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（春）结束后・挺身阻碍的鬼姐",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ddcfa13cc53f2f21837378987327c241ae545bf3c38b72cc983069670bfda43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184407f1f0052f887d7a84e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "靠着穷追不舍的跑法，\n超级溪流打倒小栗帽获得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbda23a950cce71a10c45ed4679cbe27b4bd88027af87c08e5ab02453352d868",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:203ad0cc86cfa6e01cc1f915",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了将“世界第一的训练员”这个头衔\n送给训练员，超级溪流不断取胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d6ca1926eae812e8fe30518025da5bd630df0cff554de751133c40fe5829d18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dd8bc3e0d546c898eafc2ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了实现这个梦想，\n她下一场要挑战的比赛是……“有马纪念”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f27cf2613d4b4a1b472cc8d4446e97dc82dc6b9aa02ad58ccea20c7033f5fc3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78e510fc773f559f6d85604c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（秋）结束后・坏蛋君临",
      "source_fingerprint": "50222be854fabc307b48e52273151bbcbd7851d907d2a05bc3dc63c40d35a599",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0c87f0d433e439a53990e90",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在称霸“有马纪念”后，\n盛大的欢呼声迎接着超级溪流。",
      "source_fingerprint": "018b205395c09af73d01f1c1fa8c846b8c0f925ef7e8fcd87d2da87a11a18aa6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca6ca553c2b5c857ded06faf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后，她开心地给了训练员带着\n感谢与奖励意义的“好孩子摸摸头”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7a65dc4be3397fe35d70dc22eeed69ec5226fc5d54da0ba30c70a927fb348ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7daec3888e94c53ec20a61b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "并怀着万千感慨紧紧拥抱训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a72562fd81fd42b35e1779b6f5b0908eb04f12b35304116326159d65fc606dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6420822e9570c5adfee80cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超级溪流一手栽培的训练员，\n终于成长为一流的训练员了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f0652649109a31986e8cbcaf56fe7667ca1e85bd71ebfb08373d0127e701655",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fb579155b81598f5cd03690",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・最棒的好孩子摸摸头",
      "source_fingerprint": "17ee4c1611ebfaf1c0ec2eedccf1c63816cc6e15db72920a6c6aab96df055434",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2161f083126f92f4bde568e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了替超级溪流制作训练过程中\n可以吃的小点心而去采买食材时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b5da36399b0025c684108028df3c238f0c37307d0c25faba2ea6eff20c90602",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045500.json",
      "json_path": [
